#, c-format
msgid ""
"This could also mean that the file \"%s\" could not be opened for reading or "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Dit kan ook beteken dat die lêer \"%s\" nie gelees kon word nie, of dat dit "
"nie bestaan nie."

